    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The History Channel: Battle of Britain \u2013 World War II 1940</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the pivotal aerial conflict that changed the course of history. <i>The History Channel: Battle of Britain \u2013 World War II 1940</i> puts you in the cockpit during one of World War II\u2019s most decisive battles. Defend the skies over Britain or fly for the Luftwaffe in intense dogfights, authentic historical missions, and immersive environments, all faithfully recreated from 1940\u2019s war-torn Europe. Featuring detailed aircraft, dynamic weather, and tactical air combat, this game delivers a thrilling WWII flight experience for both casual players and dedicated sim fans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly Iconic Aircraft</strong><br>Pilot authentic WWII fighters including the Supermarine Spitfire, Hawker Hurricane, Messerschmitt Bf 109, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Air Combat</strong><br>Engage in adrenaline-pumping dogfights and bombing runs with realistic flight physics and AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Campaigns</strong><br>Fight in key battles of the Battle of Britain across a branching campaign from both RAF and Luftwaffe perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade or Simulation Modes</strong><br>Choose your level of realism \u2014 jump in with simplified controls or push your skills in full sim mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Environments</strong><br>Dynamic weather effects, detailed terrain, and 1940s-era visuals bring the skies of Britain to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Footage &amp; Briefings</strong><br>Includes authentic video content and mission briefings from <i>The History Channel</i> archives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller Support</strong><br>Fully compatible with gamepads, flight sticks, and keyboard/mouse setups.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The History Channel: Battle of Britain \u2013 World War II 1940</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Description:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the pivotal aerial conflict that changed the course of history. <i>The History Channel: Battle of Britain \u2013 World War II 1940</i> puts you in the cockpit during one of World War II\u2019s most decisive battles. Defend the skies over Britain or fly for the Luftwaffe in intense dogfights, authentic historical missions, and immersive environments, all faithfully recreated from 1940\u2019s war-torn Europe. Featuring detailed aircraft, dynamic weather, and tactical air combat, this game delivers a thrilling WWII flight experience for both casual players and dedicated sim fans.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly Iconic Aircraft</strong><br>Pilot authentic WWII fighters including the Supermarine Spitfire, Hawker Hurricane, Messerschmitt Bf 109, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Air Combat</strong><br>Engage in adrenaline-pumping dogfights and bombing runs with realistic flight physics and AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Campaigns</strong><br>Fight in key battles of the Battle of Britain across a branching campaign from both RAF and Luftwaffe perspectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade or Simulation Modes</strong><br>Choose your level of realism \u2014 jump in with simplified controls or push your skills in full sim mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Environments</strong><br>Dynamic weather effects, detailed terrain, and 1940s-era visuals bring the skies of Britain to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Historical Footage &amp; Briefings</strong><br>Includes authentic video content and mission briefings from <i>The History Channel</i> archives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller Support</strong><br>Fully compatible with gamepads, flight sticks, and keyboard/mouse setups.</p></li></ul>",
